{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226580","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226580","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422658001:0":{"text":"久违了，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，还有满满和漫漫。","source_cn":"久违了，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4941482668D8E843","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"久违了，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，还有满满和漫漫。","female":"久违了，<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，还有满满和漫漫。","variant_male_record_index":"166937","variant_female_record_index":"166938","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422658002:1":{"text":"这段时间辛苦你了，布莱恩。","source_cn":"这段时间辛苦你了，布莱恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EF1395B8C58F62C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422658003:0":{"text":"这位就是来自萨洛克兰的因度厄先生吗？我是埃隆。","source_cn":"这位就是来自萨洛克兰的因度厄先生吗？我是埃隆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B55714DDCC04DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422658004:0":{"text":"请直接称呼我为因度厄吧，埃隆。感谢你专程归来。","source_cn":"请直接称呼我为因度厄吧，埃隆。感谢你专程归来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B02D2FBDE8EBCAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422658005:1":{"text":"嗯。雅顿老师已向我详述了你们的来意。事态紧急，我就不多废话了。","source_cn":"嗯。雅顿老师已向我详述了你们的来意。事态紧急，我就不多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C49547767E4EB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422658006:1":{"text":"有件事情很奇怪。就在因度厄抵达的瞬间，我感应到了鹿灵的愤怒，愤怒里还夹杂着沉痛的背叛感。","source_cn":"有件事情很奇怪。就在因度厄抵达的瞬间，我感应到了鹿灵的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEBA3D8C5A0E3758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422658007:1":{"text":"背叛？是因为我艾塞勒的身份吗？","source_cn":"背叛？是因为我艾塞勒的身份吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92F5E2B237726D73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422658008:0":{"text":"不全是。你的出现似乎触动了某种禁忌。鹿灵情绪波动得有点不同寻常，像是看到了一段不愿回忆的往事。","source_cn":"不全是。你的出现似乎触动了某种禁忌。鹿灵情绪波动得有点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC7A19508C709786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1422658008":{"text":"不全是。你的出现似乎触动了某种禁忌。鹿灵情绪波动得有点不同寻常，像是看到了一段不愿回忆的往事。","source_cn":"不全是。你的出现似乎触动了某种禁忌。鹿灵的情绪波动得有点不同寻常，像是看到了一段不愿回忆的往事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC7A19508C709786","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422658009:1":{"text":"不好说。我倒是有另外的猜想——你们在月影乡游历的时候，我回去查阅了更多的记录。","source_cn":"不好说。我倒是有另外的猜想——你们在月影乡游历的时候，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACAE1B7FAD3A9C6","variant_status":"